OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4       
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAControversial incinerator plans   
OL,4,Aapproved on appeal                     
OL,6,FMid Dorset and North Poole MP Vikki    
OL,7,FSlade called the decision a "clear step
OL,8,Fin the wrong direction", while         
OL,9,Fcampaigners had raised concerns about  
OL,10,Fthe impact on health and the plant's   
OL,11,Fproximity to homes.                    
OL,13,FHowever, a planning inspector found    
OL,14,Fthere was a need for the plant and     
OL,15,Fthat, with safeguards in place, the    
OL,16,Fevidence did not show a significant    
OL,17,Frisk to public health.                 
